  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project targets  15,225 vulnerable people with Protection activities, such a protection monitoring, referrals and case management. Community-based mobile teams for humanitarian assistance are also put in place through this project, due to the reduced access of humanitarian actors in gang-controlled neighborhoods. The project prioritizes women, girls and other vulnerable affected people for receiving assistance and basic services.</narrative>
